OL,3,AFeminist activist and journalist Gloria
OL,4,ASteinem dies at 92
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloria Steinem, who became a face of
OL,7,Fthe women's liberation movement in the
OL,8,FUS, has died, aged 92, her foundation
OL,9,Fsays.
OL,11,FIn a post on Instagram, it said she
OL,12,F"passed away peacefully" at her home in
OL,13,FNew York City, "surrounded by many who
OL,14,Floved her".
OL,16,FSteinem, who was a writer and magazine
OL,17,Feditor, co-founded the Women's Action
OL,18,FAlliance, a group dedicated to fighting
OL,19,Fsexism, more than 50 years ago.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
