OL,3,AFeminist activist and journalist Gloria
OL,4,ASteinem dies at 92
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe started her career as a journalist
OL,7,Fin New York in the 1970s and went on to
OL,8,Fco-found Ms. magazine, one of the first
OL,9,Fpublications to focus on other women's
OL,10,Fissues than housekeeping and beauty.
